----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this licence
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The MIT licence above covers the CODE in this repository (src/, Makefile, run_all.sh) and the derived
tables we produced (data/durian_mm_*.csv, intermediate/, results/).

It does NOT cover the underlying sensor data.  The raw thermal, multispectral, RGB and acoustic recordings
are the dataset "Multi-Modal Sensor Data for Durian Fruit Maturity Classification and Ripeness Assessment"
(Mesa-Satina, A. R., Kobayashi, V. B., Bayogan, E. R., & Calag, V. B., 2026; University of the Philippines
Mindanao), distributed on Zenodo under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(CC BY 4.0): https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18603796 .  The raw data are not redistributed here; the
derived tables that reference them (file names, labels, folds, per-capture features and out-of-fold
probabilities) are released under CC BY 4.0 as well, with attribution to the dataset authors.
